d  apparently already reached his wits end  with Marvel as he told cinema blend he  was actually hoping for his character to  be killed off because Marvel had failed  to develop any of the Warriors 3 and he  was apparently grateful that Cate  Blanchett's hella finished the job in  Ragnarok in the second season of  Amazon's golden globe-winning series the  marvelous mrs. Mazal Rachel Brosnahan  snoo Lee divorced midge Mazal vacations  with her family to the Catskills in  upstate New York  it's here that midge is set up with  dreamy doctor benjamin edinburgh played  with memorable swagger by zachary levi  midge and benjamin have a rocky start  but eventually their undeniable  chemistry gets the best of both of them  in an interview of The Hollywood  Reporter Levi admitted that although  he'd see  the series is pilot he actually didn't  know that the show was picked up before  he signed on then I got an offer to join  so my first bit of homework who was  binging the first season all and  essentially a day and I immediately  wanted to be a part of this it's so well  executed on every level from the top  down and to get to share screen time  with Rachel Brosnahan in that role  that's an offer you can't refuse  people think if they buy me things I'll  work harder to keep in the line are they  right yes check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite stuff are  coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

